<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Breathing, breathing, we are breathing,</l><l>With each breath new life receiving,</l><l>What a transformation from the old</l><l>to the new;</l><l>Breathing out the old life from us,</l><l>Breathing in new life and oneness,</l><l>We are breathing in of Jesus, we are</l><l>breathing in of life.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
